      "writtenOn": "2023-10-02T20:25:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So it looks like the mip code is actually fine. It does end the lifetime of the SkImages it creates before the SkData goes out of scope. And I suppose Chromium is already hosed, but it would be nice to set things up so it didn\u0027t need to be.",
